{"title":"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/0/bd0b61b19c638ea6d8a6823b260d5a429167219f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - 2 + 3 -4 + \\cdots - 98 + 99 =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"246\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/6/8e68e3bde0a1094de35c9f8c6ae69a9c68d7e33a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{\\textbf{(A)} \\ -50 } \\qquad \\mathrm{\\textbf{(B)} \\ -49 } \\qquad \\mathrm{\\textbf{(C)} \\ 0 } \\qquad \\mathrm{\\textbf{(D)} \\ 49 } \\qquad \\mathrm{\\textbf{(E)} \\ 50 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"432\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>If we group consecutive terms together, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/e/e2e0bf358ebf5ece9c93a8b94c424af48b21c07f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1) + (-1) + \\cdots + 99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" />, and since there are 49 pairs of terms the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91ac2077be228e49b805860a2ef9b803007a1f5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-49 + 99 = 50 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"173\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>( Similar to Solution 1 )\nIf we rearranged the terms, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/3/d2345343c73820ccc3afc0e18187c49e91e19952.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+3-2+5-4 \\cdots + 99-98$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"238\" height=\"14\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0c049c4816ae4d96ccb8df9d386d49d30e5804a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 1 + \\cdots + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"13\" />, and since there are 49 pairs of terms and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the beginning the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bba94e413068b4a7e293184782aa78b81b7bc8f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+49 = 50 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{\\textbf(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601430133217af2db66c40045d71bf8309f2b0e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - 2 + 3 -4 + \\cdots - 98 + 99 = S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"263\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/3/d73ddb6535c7df74e272b785c5f228a0d14e5c96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=99-98+97-\\cdots -4+3-2+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"303\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>We add:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda4da22f939250cdd78fc12d64d596e08889086.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2S=100-100+100-100\\cdots +100=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"348\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/a/3ca8124d7ffff88d7c7b90e22759b9fdabc83e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=50\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We proceed with addition, 1 -2 + 3 -4.... Once done we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/d/95daf766b1f3b9385a49e39f765a7b07fa61e39b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME\" title=\"1999 AHSME\">1999 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1999\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b>